`Schedule 4 'affidavit'` MEANS DictionaryEntry OF "affidavit, in the case of persons for the time being allowed by law to affirm, declare or promise", (LIST "affidavit"), Includes, "affidavit, in the case of persons for the time being allowed by law to affirm, declare or promise, includes affirmation, declaration and promise.", EMPTY

